mods/omp-agents/main.js is adapted from the space-groups-agents mod in
https://github.com/suppa-duppa-labs/herdr-space-groups, which is adapted from
the agents mod shipped with https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE).

The space-groups-agents adaptation added the Grouped by folder sort using
space groups. This adaptation adds read-only native OMP child observations,
per-parent TODO expansion, and snapshot freshness handling while retaining
the original native child tree, grouping, pinning, and navigation behavior.
